---
description: NestJS API rules for apps/api/
globs: apps/api/**
---

Full rules in `docs/rules/api.md`. Key points:

- Clean Architecture: `presentation/ → application/ → domain/ ← infrastructure/`
- All modules under `src/modules/<domain>/`
- TypeORM + PostgreSQL; `synchronize: false`; migrations in `src/migrations/`
- `deleted_at: Date | null` on all syncable ORM entities
- Thin controllers; DTOs with `class-validator`; services call domain repository ports
- `@Public()` for public routes; `@Roles()` for role enforcement
- Response always `{ data: T }` via ResponseInterceptor
- No financial data in logs
